  International** license (**CC BY 4.0**). Full text:
  [LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt](LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt).

If a file contains both code and content, the code portions are MIT-licensed and the
content portions are CC BY 4.0.

“Non-commercial” in project descriptions describes our intent, not a license
restriction. CC BY 4.0 permits commercial reuse of our original content with
attribution. IEC/ISO metadata, names, titles, and publication content are not
relicensed by this project and are excluded from these grants.

## What is not covered

IEC and ISO publication content, titles, trademarks and other third-party material are not
licensed by this project. They remain the property of their respective owners and are
referenced for identification only. See [NOTICE.md](NOTICE.md).

No IEC document bodies are included in this repository.

This repository is **not official IEC or ISO communication, documentation, or a
source of record of any kind**. It is an independent, unofficial aggregate of
publicly available information and may contain errors. Always verify against the
official IEC/ISO catalog and the current editions of standards.

